WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.900
Meet Spool Ledger.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.033
Your filament settings already work. Moving slicers should not mean rebuilding them.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:18.700
Choose the profiles and official printers you want. Review the exact local plan before anything changes.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.200
See every output, conflict, and missing dependency before commit.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:32.800
Local creation, Bambu loading, cloud IDs, and AMS checks stay separate.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:39.767
Restore only run-owned paths. Files changed later are preserved.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.233
Review the workflow and download Spool Ledger.
